# Direct CPU dependencies for Linux x86_64 (Python 3.11) GitHub Actions CI target (FA-04, ACC-01)
# Note: mlflow is intentionally optional (omitted here to keep CI lean; install separately via
# `pip install mlflow` if local SQLite tracking is desired).
# Recompile Linux CPU lockfile from repo root via:
#   uv pip compile requirements-cpu.in --python-platform x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu \
#     --python-version 3.11 --index-url https://pypi.org/simple \
#     --extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cpu \
#     --index-strategy unsafe-best-match -o requirements-cpu.lock
